Bead critical-2r6.4 is done. Here's what was built:

- **`seeds/spells.json`** — 885 spells (511 Wizard + 374 Priest), sorted by class → level → name, with snake_case field names: `name`, `class`, `level`, `school`, `sphere`, `casting_time`, `range`, `duration`, `area_of_effect`, `components`, `saving_throw`, `description`
- **`seeds/spells.schema.json`** — JSON Schema documenting every field with types and descriptions
- Wizard levels 1–6 (Bard range): 403 spells — acceptance criterion met
- `jq . seeds/spells.json` passes — valid JSON

**Notable gotchas handled:** The site is an Angular SPA; data was in static assets (`/assets/WizardSpells.json`, `/assets/PriestSpells.json`). One Wizard spell (Clairvoyance) had its casting time embedded in the components field due to upstream data corruption — extracted via regex. Three Priest spells were missing the `save` field — handled with `.get()` fallback.

Changes staged and ready to commit.
